-- title:
--   From HTo GAdjacent Stage M4 Eq Final Right Shape
-- statement:
--   **The global M4 stage equals its final right-action average.** Let $M_4$ denote `fromHToGAdjacentStageM4`, and set $n=k-(\ell+1)$. Write $S$, $U$, and $T$ for the recurrence weight, G-hat outcome operator, and half-product operator instantiated by the averaging variables and outcomes. Then
--
--   $$
--   M_4=\mathbb E_{(x,xs)}\sum_{g,gs}
--   \operatorname{ev}_{\psi}\!\left(\bigl(L(TT^{\dagger})R(SU)\bigr)R(U)\right).
--   $$
--
--   The expectation is uniform on $\mathbb{F}_q\times\operatorname{PointTuple}(n)$. The definitions of $S$, $U$, and $T$ retain the exact recurrence weights and G-hat operators from the formal stage. This is the global counterpart of the pointwise M4 rewrite.
--
--   Formalization credit: Sirui Lu, Ruixuan Deng, Yanqiao Zhu, and Zhengfeng Ji (arXiv:2609.19814). Mathematical source: Zhengfeng Ji, Anand Natarajan, Thomas Vidick, John Wright, and Henry Yuen (arXiv:2009.12982).
--
--   **Formalization Note.** The source declaration is `MIPStarRE.LDT.Pasting.fromHToGAdjacentStageM4_eq_finalRightShape`; its Lean statement gives the exact quantifier order and all boundary hypotheses.
